[{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0956:b004:l034","ordinal":259329,"en":"Upon my newly returned brother."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0956:b004:l035","ordinal":259330,"en":"Damn you, seers!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0956:b004:l036","ordinal":259331,"en":"From time immemorial"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0956:b004:l037","ordinal":259332,"en":"You have never ceased your trickery;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0956:b004:l038","ordinal":259333,"en":"You speak evil words and never prosper."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0956:b004:l039","ordinal":259334,"en":"Though our father Chilaba is one,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l001","ordinal":259335,"en":"You speak of estrangement"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l002","ordinal":259336,"en":"And will not cease your mischief."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l003","ordinal":259337,"en":"You make words blaze like fire,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l004","ordinal":259338,"en":"And turn my brother into an enemy."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l005","ordinal":259339,"en":"You make my own kin a foe,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l006","ordinal":259340,"en":"And do this to me."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l007","ordinal":259341,"en":"You meant to make my lament be sung,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l008","ordinal":259342,"en":"You roaring seers,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l009","ordinal":259343,"en":"And have worsened my wound."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l010","ordinal":259344,"en":"By speaking such vicious words,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l011","ordinal":259345,"en":"You meant to cost me my head."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l012","ordinal":259346,"en":"You seers meant to question me"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l013","ordinal":259347,"en":"About some far-off youth of mine."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l014","ordinal":259348,"en":"You meant to rot my treasure;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l015","ordinal":259349,"en":"By committing this boundless deed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l016","ordinal":259350,"en":"Damn you, diviners,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l017","ordinal":259351,"en":"You meant to bring about my end."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l018","ordinal":259352,"en":"You mounted a swift horse to scout,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l019","ordinal":259353,"en":"And by yelping on, you seers,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l020","ordinal":259354,"en":"You meant to part me from my brother.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l021","ordinal":259355,"en":"Thus Kongurbay spoke,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l022","ordinal":259356,"en":"Hunched in fury,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l023","ordinal":259357,"en":"Bristling in distress."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l024","ordinal":259358,"en":"As though darkness had fallen upon his wife,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l025","ordinal":259359,"en":"Kongurbay capered wildly,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l026","ordinal":259360,"en":"As though fleeing a pursuer."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l027","ordinal":259361,"en":"He stiffened in wrath,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l028","ordinal":259362,"en":"Looking ready to swallow them alive;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l029","ordinal":259363,"en":"His eyes boiled in every direction,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l030","ordinal":259364,"en":"And he gnashed those formidable teeth,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l031","ordinal":259365,"en":"Chewing them side to side."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l032","ordinal":259366,"en":"His eyes bulged from their sockets,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l033","ordinal":259367,"en":"Huge as the bays of a lake;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l034","ordinal":259368,"en":"Such was the accursed man’s bearing—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l035","ordinal":259369,"en":"He seemed ready to swallow anyone he saw."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l036","ordinal":259370,"en":"He stamped the earth in frenzy,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l037","ordinal":259371,"en":"And the Kalcha hero began to speak."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l038","ordinal":259372,"en":"When they saw Kongurbay’s wrath,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b003:l039","ordinal":259373,"en":"The forty tribes of China"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l001","ordinal":259374,"en":"And their vaunted lions"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l002","ordinal":259375,"en":"All wailed together,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l003","ordinal":259376,"en":"Abandoning all hope of life."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l004","ordinal":259377,"en":"Then Kongurbay, son of Alööke,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l005","ordinal":259378,"en":"Let out a swine-like roar."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l006","ordinal":259379,"en":"Such was the Kalcha’s state—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l007","ordinal":259380,"en":"A dreadful marvel to behold."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l008","ordinal":259381,"en":"In his wrath, he looked able"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l009","ordinal":259382,"en":"To reap the Chinese with his sword;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l010","ordinal":259383,"en":"If he made a move, he looked able"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l011","ordinal":259384,"en":"To swallow every last Chinese man."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l012","ordinal":259385,"en":"His gray-wolf ferocity revealed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l013","ordinal":259386,"en":"Such was Kongurbay to behold."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l014","ordinal":259387,"en":"“Damn you, Chinese people!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l015","ordinal":259388,"en":"Clamorously worshipping stones,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l016","ordinal":259389,"en":"You have set yourselves above me."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l017","ordinal":259390,"en":"Between elder and younger brother,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l018","ordinal":259391,"en":"You Chinese have come"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l019","ordinal":259392,"en":"And sought to divide us."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l020","ordinal":259393,"en":"Having made me the Kalcha’s seer,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l021","ordinal":259394,"en":"What is it you intended to do?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l022","ordinal":259395,"en":"You snarling Chinese dogs"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l023","ordinal":259396,"en":"Have plainly sought"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l024","ordinal":259397,"en":"To bring about my end;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l025","ordinal":259398,"en":"You sought to destroy the Kalcha"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l026","ordinal":259399,"en":"And depart, you Chinese,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l027","ordinal":259400,"en":"Toward the Khakan’s realm."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l028","ordinal":259401,"en":"If you provoke my boundless fury,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l029","ordinal":259402,"en":"I will strip off your Chinese robes"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l030","ordinal":259403,"en":"And make a splendid slaughter."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l031","ordinal":259404,"en":"If frenzy seizes me,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l032","ordinal":259405,"en":"May I perish if I do not settle all your accounts together."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l033","ordinal":259406,"en":"If I stiffen in rage,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l034","ordinal":259407,"en":"May I perish if I do not crush your distant fury.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l035","ordinal":259408,"en":"Thus spoke Kongurbay:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l036","ordinal":259409,"en":"“Damn you, men of the Khakan!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l037","ordinal":259410,"en":"Claiming you would set things right, forty seers,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l038","ordinal":259411,"en":"You have plundered my possessions"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l039","ordinal":259412,"en":"And brought this discord upon me."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l001","ordinal":259413,"en":"Damn you, seers!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l002","ordinal":259414,"en":"Saying you knew the hardships of the Altai,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l003","ordinal":259415,"en":"You told me many tales."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l004","ordinal":259416,"en":"Who would believe your words?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l005","ordinal":259417,"en":"You have become my enemies."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l006","ordinal":259418,"en":"You muttering seers,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l007","ordinal":259419,"en":"You appear as foes in my eyes."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l008","ordinal":259420,"en":"Keep far from this path, seers;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l009","ordinal":259421,"en":"Never appear before my eyes."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l010","ordinal":259422,"en":"When I mount for battle, none can humble me;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l011","ordinal":259423,"en":"What man could ever catch"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l012","ordinal":259424,"en":"A winged racehorse?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l013","ordinal":259425,"en":"You have shown hostility"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l014","ordinal":259426,"en":"Toward my kinsman who has returned."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l015","ordinal":259427,"en":"You glared at him with hatred"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l016","ordinal":259428,"en":"When my brother came home."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l017","ordinal":259429,"en":"Our father is Khakan Chilaba;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l018","ordinal":259430,"en":"We wandered astray and grew up apart—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l019","ordinal":259431,"en":"Ask no more about our kinship.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l020","ordinal":259432,"en":"Thus Kongurbay spoke."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l021","ordinal":259433,"en":"His great boots curved at the toes,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l022","ordinal":259434,"en":"And his neck arched like a rooster’s."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l023","ordinal":259435,"en":"His spectacles gleamed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l024","ordinal":259436,"en":"While Zulpukor, which cut with every stroke,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l025","ordinal":259437,"en":"Flashed upon his wrist."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l026","ordinal":259438,"en":"When he arched back and drew his dagger,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l027","ordinal":259439,"en":"From the dagger’s edge"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l028","ordinal":259440,"en":"Sparks rose as large as a nomad’s camp."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l029","ordinal":259441,"en":"Six thousand Chinese san-kaldai"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l030","ordinal":259442,"en":"Stopped without uttering a word."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l031","ordinal":259443,"en":"“Your hearts are hostile and your tongues are venomous;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l032","ordinal":259444,"en":"You Chinese—I bear a grudge against you."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l033","ordinal":259445,"en":"You have set out to block"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l034","ordinal":259446,"en":"My broad and open road;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l035","ordinal":259447,"en":"Falsely claiming to be seers,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l036","ordinal":259448,"en":"You cunning men have sought somehow"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l037","ordinal":259449,"en":"To put my heart in order."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l038","ordinal":259450,"en":"By making my brother a stranger,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l039","ordinal":259451,"en":"You have sought your opportune hour."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l001","ordinal":259452,"en":"Saying you wished now to learn"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l002","ordinal":259453,"en":"Of the six-month ordeal,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l003","ordinal":259454,"en":"Look how the ill-omened Manchus"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l004","ordinal":259455,"en":"Have spoken lies."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l005","ordinal":259456,"en":"I chose to listen to your words;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l006","ordinal":259457,"en":"By babbling such nonsense,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l007","ordinal":259458,"en":"Whom have I ever corrupted?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l008","ordinal":259459,"en":"When I stiffen in rage,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l009","ordinal":259460,"en":"I will not leave one of you untouched."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l010","ordinal":259461,"en":"If you boast that you are seers,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l011","ordinal":259462,"en":"Do not stir my Chinese wrath."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l012","ordinal":259463,"en":"When I rage and storm,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l013","ordinal":259464,"en":"I will not leave one of you untouched;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l014","ordinal":259465,"en":"Until now I have endured your conduct."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l015","ordinal":259466,"en":"You have committed countless deeds;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l016","ordinal":259467,"en":"While I continued to spare you,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l017","ordinal":259468,"en":"You brought violence upon my golden head."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l018","ordinal":259469,"en":"I called you clairvoyants, seers,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l019","ordinal":259470,"en":"But you did not do this once—you did it a thousand times;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l020","ordinal":259471,"en":"You passed a judgment no man could bear to hear."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l021","ordinal":259472,"en":"By openly calling him a Burut,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l022","ordinal":259473,"en":"Damn you, swine,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l023","ordinal":259474,"en":"You stirred strife against my brother."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l024","ordinal":259475,"en":"You have grieved me, seers;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l025","ordinal":259476,"en":"Shall I dig your graves?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l026","ordinal":259477,"en":"Shall I fall upon all of you"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l027","ordinal":259478,"en":"And make a glorious slaughter?”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l028","ordinal":259479,"en":"Thus Kongurbay spoke,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l029","ordinal":259480,"en":"Arming himself for battle,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l030","ordinal":259481,"en":"Slung his great gun across his body,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l031","ordinal":259482,"en":"And brandished in his hand,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l032","ordinal":259483,"en":"Ready for use, his keen sword."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l033","ordinal":259484,"en":"Such was the rabid Kalcha,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l034","ordinal":259485,"en":"Hunched in fury,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l035","ordinal":259486,"en":"The hair atop his head standing on end,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l036","ordinal":259487,"en":"Bristling as though he meant"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l037","ordinal":259488,"en":"To slaughter the snarling Chinese,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l038","ordinal":259489,"en":"His thoughts dark with rage."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l039","ordinal":259490,"en":"The Manchus and their khans—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l001","ordinal":259491,"en":"What is the butcher now?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l002","ordinal":259492,"en":"Albanian different souls."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l003","ordinal":259493,"en":"Screaming angrily"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l004","ordinal":259494,"en":"Don't hesitate to call"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l005","ordinal":259495,"en":"Calling his wrestlers."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l006","ordinal":259496,"en":"They sing their hands,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l007","ordinal":259497,"en":"Come all of you - he said."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l008","ordinal":259498,"en":"\"Your blood from Manchu come,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l009","ordinal":259499,"en":"Er Ezkara everyone come!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l010","ordinal":259500,"en":"I'm getting confused"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l011","ordinal":259501,"en":"Don't stand up Chinese, come to me!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l012","ordinal":259502,"en":"Alien wrestler before me,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l013","ordinal":259503,"en":"If a relative is found,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l014","ordinal":259504,"en":"If the conscience is closed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l015","ordinal":259505,"en":"My relative who died at birth"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l016","ordinal":259506,"en":"You are really insulting."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l017","ordinal":259507,"en":"Your blood, your blood,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l018","ordinal":259508,"en":"There will be a black runner,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l019","ordinal":259509,"en":"Don't come to me."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l020","ordinal":259510,"en":"Gray than a white horse"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l021","ordinal":259511,"en":"How about a murderer?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l022","ordinal":259512,"en":"This is your father's day."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l023","ordinal":259513,"en":"Agar gold, white silver"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l024","ordinal":259514,"en":"How about a murderer?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l025","ordinal":259515,"en":"Gold and silver"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l026","ordinal":259516,"en":"Let's appreciate the mule,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l027","ordinal":259517,"en":"This is your father's day."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l028","ordinal":259518,"en":"Let's go to Semetei."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l029","ordinal":259519,"en":"Do not quarrel, do not quarrel,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l030","ordinal":259520,"en":"Safe Chinese"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l031","ordinal":259521,"en":"Let's go back to our month."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l032","ordinal":259522,"en":"Like a star in the sky"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l033","ordinal":259523,"en":"How come you are gray?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l034","ordinal":259524,"en":"O murderer of the world"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l035","ordinal":259525,"en":"How are you a friend?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l036","ordinal":259526,"en":"Tulpar steam to kerem"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l037","ordinal":259527,"en":"How are you?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l038","ordinal":259528,"en":"Kokjal Manas Day -"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l039","ordinal":259529,"en":"To draw a runner"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l001","ordinal":259530,"en":"How did you give?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l002","ordinal":259531,"en":"Meet the murderer"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l003","ordinal":259532,"en":"Give a good day,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l004","ordinal":259533,"en":"See you in a field"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l005","ordinal":259534,"en":"Faced from a hill,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l006","ordinal":259535,"en":"Let's save Kakan."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l007","ordinal":259536,"en":"Don't mess up, don't fight,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l008","ordinal":259537,"en":"General Chinese-Kakanchi"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l009","ordinal":259538,"en":"Let's go back to Beijing."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l010","ordinal":259539,"en":"Walking a hard way without stopping,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l011","ordinal":259540,"en":"Let's walk the right path."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l012","ordinal":259541,"en":"Reconciliation is for the people,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l013","ordinal":259542,"en":"Let's tell the blood."},{"id":"semetey-2-201